                                                "text": "to brace the nerves"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94344357-f700-4c01-9a8c-c8b248ae17b3",
                                                "sense_id": "33d36fbc-f572-35ea-9b0a-e915153a7a97",
                                                "text": "And welcome war to brace her drums."
