                                                "example_id": "949159bc-319c-4a76-b997-1ba620b3e1a1",
                                                "sense_id": "eab53c79-38ab-318f-a1a3-3c59cc833e21",
                                                "text": "The women of China[…], by bracing and binding them [their feet] from their infancy, have very little feet."
